Used for: MIMXRT1062.h (register layouts, masks, base addresses, IRQ
numbers, field value documentation), fsl_iomuxc.h (pin-mux tuples),
fsl_clock.h (clock-gate encoding), fsl_flexspi_nor_boot.h and
evkmimxrt1060_flexspi_nor_config.h (IVT, boot data and FCB layouts),
system_MIMXRT1062.c (what SystemInit does; soc/imxrt1062/soc.ad follows its
order), MIMXRT1062xxxxx_flexspi_nor.ld (evidence that OCRAM2 and FlexRAM
OCRAM are one contiguous range; read, not used).

